{"2522530": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Last-Hit Defense", "steam_appid": 2522530, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<h1>Coupon Code</h1><p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Please enter the following coupon code in-game</h2><strong>&quot;EarlyBird&quot;, &quot;Access&quot;, &quot;Infinity&quot;, &quot;Universe&quot;<br>&quot;Peaceful&quot;, &quot;Birthday&quot;, &quot;Last_Hit&quot;, <br>&quot;Hello_World&quot;, &quot;Happy_World&quot;, &quot;Be_Happy&quot;</strong></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2522530/extras/89c55600f7c7603f1884ec2a56c81cc1.avif?t=1720613481\" width=600 height=291 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Defense + Action = Innovative Action-Defense Game !!</h2><strong>You can get energy by killing monsters by hitting the last-hit as a hero.<br>When the energy obtained from the last-hit is charged, you can build a tower.<br>Without towers, you can't stop the growing wave of monsters.<br>However, the dilemma is that it becomes difficult to hit the last-hit when there are more towers !<br>The only solution to this is strategically building towers and focusing on the last-hit.</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2522530/extras/ec6014eceafdb6ca8fbab5412d23188a.avif?t=1720613481\" width=600 height=291 /></span><br><br>★ Stages with colorful features and overwhelming bosses !<br>★ Heroes who use their unique attacks and skills !<br>★ A wide selection of equipment to make your hero stronger !<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2522530/extras/ef5e38d99c09a48db083bd647d8b13c6.avif?t=1720613481\" width=600 height=291 /></span><br><br>★ Strategic selection and construction of towers according to the stage !<br>★ Vario